#: src/developer-faq.md:174
msgid ""
"If you are using the Podman Build you need any Linux or Unix-like "
"distribution supporting Podman 4.0 or newer and FUSE 3.x (if you have "
"problems with FUSE in the host system there's [this](./advanced-podman-build."
