"container instead of host system)"
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:175
msgid ""
"If you are using the Native Build a recent Ubuntu, PopOS or Fedora version "
"is recommended"
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:177
msgid ""
"The following hardware requirements are enough for fast compilation of the "
"system and most applications, but some heavy applications may require more."
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:179
msgid "An Intel or AMD CPU newer than 10 years with 4 cores/threads or more"
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:180
msgid "4GB DDR4 RAM or more (8GB or 16GB for heavy applications)"
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:181
msgid ""
