msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:198
msgid "When I should rebuild the build system or recipes from scratch?"
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:200
msgid ""
"Sometimes the execution of the `make pull rebuild` command is not enough to "
"update the build system and recipes because of breaking changes, learn what "
"to do on the following changes:"
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:202
msgid ""
"New relibc functions and fixes: to allow a recipe to use the new relibc "
"functions you need to rebuild it with the `make cr.recipe-name` command, "
"sometimes relibc fixes require a complete system rebuild by running the "
"`make repo_clean all` command"
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:203
msgid ""
"Dependency changes on recipes: if the shared objects had symbol changes or "
"the recipe is statically linked, run the `make cr.recipe-name` command"
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:204
msgid "Configuration changes on recipes: run the `make cr.recipe-name` command"
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:205
msgid ""
