msgid "GitLab Questions"
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:502
msgid "How do I request a review or review MRs properly?"
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:504
msgid "These rules prevent you from wasting time and stress."
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:506
msgid ""
"**Don't edit your code suggestions without a warning before to prevent merge "
"errors and review disorganization**"
msgstr ""

#: src/developer-faq.md:507
